            "title": "JAPAN QUALITY: An Unrelenting Pursuit of Quality"
          }
        },
        "about_quality_text_pursuit": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>High-quality raw down, raised in the rugged landscape of Spain, is carefully washed in Japan and refined into safe, high-quality down. To fully bring out the performance of this down, our factory carefully sews each product using designs that combine years of hands-on experience with data based on scientific research conducted in our lab.</p><p>From material development to final finishing, and through the aftercare we provide once a product reaches you, NANGA is always dedicated to the best possible craftsmanship.</p>"
          }
        },
        "about_quality_sub_washing": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Down Washed in Japan"
          }
        },
        "about_quality_text_washing": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>To bring out the full performance of down, it must be clean and free of impurities. For this reason, the down we use is washed by Kawada Feather, a down processing company known for its custom designed equipment and advanced technical skill. High quality down is produced by making use of the ultra soft groundwater nurtured by the surrounding mountains, along with the climate of the Ise Plain in Mie Prefecture, which is well suited for drying down.</p>"
          }
        },
