        "about_quality_text_artisans": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Attention to detail, even in the parts users never see, is the NANGA standard. Because everything, from down filling and sewing to maintenance, happens in our own factory, each step is carried out with care, resulting in safe and reliable products. The skill of our experienced artisans raises the precision of every product, allowing us to deliver items that satisfy our customers.</p>"
